// base is hit, and when an enemy is wiped out (AIPlayer::personaChat)
GUI:AIChatAttackerWave1
"Here we come. Again."
END

GUI:AIChatAttackerWave2
"No rest for you today."
END

GUI:AIChatAttackerHit1
"Hitting me back? Cute."
END

GUI:AIChatAttackerWin1
"Next!"
END

GUI:AIChatTurtleWave1
"The walls are done. Now we march."
END

GUI:AIChatTurtleWave2
"Slow and steady, coming your way."
END

GUI:AIChatTurtleHit1
"Knock all you like. Nobody is home to you."
END

GUI:AIChatTurtleWin1
"Patience wins."
END

GUI:AIChatEconomistWave1
"Consider this an investment."
END

GUI:AIChatEconomistWave2
"Paid for in full. Delivering now."
END

GUI:AIChatEconomistHit1
"Do you know what that building cost?"
END

GUI:AIChatEconomistWin1
"Bankrupt. Closing the account."
END

GUI:AIChatAirWave1
"Look up."
END

GUI:AIChatAirWave2
"Wheels up, weapons hot."
END

GUI:AIChatAirHit1
"Ground troops. How quaint."
END

GUI:AIChatAirWin1
"Air superiority confirmed."
END

GUI:AIChatRusherWave1
"Everything I have, right now!"
END

GUI:AIChatRusherWave2
"Faster, faster!"
END

GUI:AIChatRusherHit1
"You were supposed to be dead by now."
END

GUI:AIChatRusherWin1
"Too slow."
END

GUI:AIChatRaiderWave1
"Your trucks look lonely."
END

GUI:AIChatRaiderWave2
"Hit and gone."
END

GUI:AIChatRaiderHit1
"So you found the way to my base too."
END

GUI:AIChatRaiderWin1
"No supplies, no army."
END

GUI:AIChatTechWave1
"Field test, live targets."
END

GUI:AIChatTechWave2
"The prototypes are ready."
END

GUI:AIChatTechHit1
"Mind the lab, that equipment is expensive."
END

GUI:AIChatTechWin1
"Experiment concluded."
END

GUI:AIChatInfantryWave1
"Boots on the ground!"
END

GUI:AIChatInfantryWave2
"Every street, every window."
END

GUI:AIChatInfantryHit1
"Into the buildings, hold the line!"
END

GUI:AIChatInfantryWin1
"The city is ours."
END

GUI:AIChatArmorWave1
"Steel is rolling."
END

GUI:AIChatArmorWave2
"Hear the tracks? That is us."
END

GUI:AIChatArmorHit1
"You scratched the paint."
END

GUI:AIChatArmorWin1
"Flattened."
END

GUI:AIChatSneakyWave1
"You did not see this coming."
